      "disposition": "stock_product_mixture_context",
      "reasoning": "JCM969 explicitly specifies EBIOS dried-yeast tablets from Asahi Food & Healthcare. The frozen MediaDive1953 provenance of existing EBIOS owner also describes dried-yeast tablets, so this is a bounded edit of that owner, not another yeast-extract record. Unknown excipients do not prevent this source-qualified tablet-family identity. The exact product/form label EBIOS* (dried yeast tablets) can resolve to this bounded tablet family after checking its Asahi footnote; bare EBIOS remains rejected.",
      "applicability": "Only case92 and its sole JCM969/TOGO1019 frozen occurrence are attached here;10g is an addition to the receiving agar, not a component proportion. The qualified tablet raw label is retained as RAW_TEXT, without inferring excipients or lot equivalence. No whole generic EBIOS label, P2G, current catalogue formulation or worker02 historical tablet formulation is declared equivalent.",
